> act_prog p mighty wave.~
if iscarrying($n) == 215
   mea $n You gaze out at the shoreline as the wave begins to die out...
   mer $n You watch $n look out dreamily as the wave begins to die out...
   if rand(66)
      mea $n You milk the last little bit of the wave, cruising towards the shore...
      mer $n You watch $n milk the last little bit of the wave, cruising towards the shore...
      mpforce $n n
      mpat $n mpforce $n surfon
   else
       mea $n You try to stay on the wave, but instead you bail out fantastically!
       mer $n Despite $n's efforts, $e bails off the wave fantastically!
    endif
else
   mea $n ...but you'll need a surfboard to attempt that!
endif~
> rand_prog 25~
mea $n A small wave crashes into your legs on its way to shore...~
