   mea $n You ride up the wave again, and pull a floater off of the top...
   mer $n You watch $n shoot up the wave again, and pull a floater off the top...
   if rand(66)
      mea $n You slip back down into the wave, crouching low to gain more speed...
      mer $n You watch $n slip back down into the wave, crouching low to gain more speed...
      mpforce $n e
      mpat $n mpforce $n surfon
   else
       mea $n You try to stay on the wave, but instead you bail out fantastically!
       mer $n Despite $n's efforts, $e bails off the wave fantastically!
    endif
else
   mea $n ...but you'll need a surfboard to attempt that!
endif~
> rand_prog 25~
