0 0 3034
> act_prog p mighty wave.~
if iscarrying($n) == 215
   mea $n You twist to your left and shoot down the tunnel of the building curl...
   mer $n You watch $n twist left and shoot down the tunnel of the building curl...
   if rand(66)
      mea $n You ride down the curl, the sound of the wave echoing throughout the tube...
      mer $n You watch $n ride down the curl, sometimes disappearing into the wave itself!
      mpforce $n n
      mpat $n mpforce $n surfon
   else
       mea $n You try to stay on the wave, but instead you bail out fantastically!
       mer $n Despite $n's efforts, $e bails off the wave fantastically!
    endif
else
   mea $n ...but you'll need a surfboard to attempt that!
endif~
> rand_prog 25~
mea $n A large wave goes roaring past you...~
|
