0 0 3046
> rand_prog 50~
mea $n A large swell rolls towards you, then glides past you...that could of been the perfect wave...
~
> act_prog p perfect wave.~
if iscarrying($n) == 215
   mea $n You see a large swell approaching, and begin to paddle...
   mer $n You watch $n begin to paddle, trying to catch the oncoming wave...
   if rand(33)
      mea $n You begin to move faster as the force building in the swell grows larger...
      mer $n You watch $n paddle into the swell, picking up speed as the swell grows...
      mpforce $n n
      mpat $n mpforce $n surfup
   else
       mea $n You paddle hard, but fail to catch the growing swell...
       mer $n Despite $n's efforts, $e fails to catch to wave...
    endif
else
   mea $n ...but you'll need a surfboard to attempt that!
endif~
|
