and waves threaten to pull you down into the deep.  The faint cries of gulls
can be heard in the sky.  All about you, there is nothing but water, as far as
the eye can see.  To the north, you hear the crashing of large waves as they
form in the break.
~
0 0 7
D0
~
~
16777216 0 3050
D1
Exit description~
~
0 0 3120
D2
Exit description~
~
0 0 3180
D3
~
~
0 0 3118
S
